<title>USA: Oshman's Sporting Goods Q4 shr loss $2.59.</title>
<headline>Oshman's Sporting Goods Q4 shr loss $2.59.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>OSHMAN'S SPORTING GOODS, INC.</p>
<p>	  (in thousands, except for per share and store data)</p>
<p>				     Q4 ended	    Year ended</p>
<p>				 Feb 1,   Feb 3,     Feb 1,    Feb 3,</p>
<p>				 1997	1996	 1997	1996</p>
